# Every deploy builds server/Dockerfile with the repository as its context: Render, Fly, Cloudflare
# and `docker compose … --build`. The image copies the files it needs by name, so what follows would
# only be uploaded to the builder for nothing — downloads/ above all, where the server keeps every
# file it fetched when it runs from a checkout.
